  "description": "Ocean Property Management are delighted to present this beautifully finished two-bedroom apartment in the heart of Barna, Co. Galway. Ideally situated in a well-maintained, landscaped development, the property enjoys a superb location within walking distance of Barna National School, local shops, cafés, restaurants, and all the excellent amenities the village has to offer. The apartment is also just a short drive from Galway City, making it an ideal choice for those seeking a coastal village lifestyle with easy access to the city.\n\nFinished to a high standard throughout, the apartment features, a bright and spacious open-plan living/dining area complete, two generous double bedrooms, including a master with en-suite, and a stylish main bathroom. The property also benefits from gas-fired central heating.",
